        "type": "p",
        "text": "When you are ready, selling is its own kind of work. I also run [Your Next Step Team](https://yournextstepteam.com), where we help Washington families sell homes through exactly these transitions, so I know a listing like this is not an ordinary listing. It needs patience with the timeline and gentleness with the contents. Whoever you choose, ask whether they have done this before."
